    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Red Russian kale is a nutrient-dense, hardy leafy green packed with vitamins A, C, and K, along with high levels of antioxidants like quercetin and iron. Its deep red/purple stems signify anthocyanins, which reduce inflammation and protect against chronic diseases. It&nbsp;supports immune health, strong bones, and digestion.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p>",
